config QCOM_SAMURAI_EUD_ROUTE
	bool "RMX1931 boot-disabled EUD route ownership"
	depends on QCOM_SAMURAI_EUD_HANDOFF && ARM64 && ARCH_QCOM && OF
	default n
	help
	  Bind real route/USB devices to the paired firmware evidence and
	  arbitrate every paired EUD producer before MMIO/SCM. The provider
	  owns client references and revokes/joins before releasing exclusion.
	  Boot evidence currently expires at system PM prepare; no resume-time
	  permission is inferred before hardware retention is proved.
